  "description": "LAMLOE crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 Nd4 O22 U2,2(C6 H6). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd5 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd6 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd7 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd8 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.740-3.744 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.71-106.97°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132Nd4O22U2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
